{"content": {"exact_text": "BURST Generator extracts continues server-to-client or client-to-server packets in one session flow, named as BURST [28, 33], to represent the partial complete information of a session.", "field": "traffic.traffic_unit", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:38.566201Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "method_description", "id": "E0001", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.95, "x1": 559.72, "y0": 86.48, "y1": 205.03}, "block": "B0084", "char_end": 293, "char_start": 108, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 3, "section_path": ["3 ET-BERT", "3.2 Datagram2Token Traffic Representation"], "text_hash": "sha256:c42c92e9ea223a1bda552aaf310c7bd5d8bade403414c7040d06407aa3982aee", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:36:06.591018Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span establishes BURST as the unit, derived from a session flow.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:36:06.590998Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "We first propose a raw traffic representation model to transform the datagram to language-like tokens for pre-training.", "field": "traffic.representation_family", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:38.696170Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "representation_description", "id": "E0002", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 53.8, "x1": 295.56, "y0": 338.53, "y1": 555.72}, "block": "B0064", "char_end": 407, "char_start": 288, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 2, "section_path": ["KEYWORDS"], "text_hash": "sha256:c142222ef18741e989862b6cc6e14fe8c06b8d77f1eac96001d331238bb925f6", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:36:19.867553Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span states that the input is the raw datagram.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:36:19.867536Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "PERT [13] first applies the pre-training model to migrate ALBERT to encrypted traffic classification and achieves 93.23% performance in ISCX-VPN-Service [9] on F1", "field": "traffic.metrics", "negative_state": null, "numeric": {"condition": {"reported_by": "ET-BERT related work", "system": "PERT"}, "dataset": "ISCX-VPN-Service", "metric": "F1", "parsed": 93.23, "raw": "93.23%", "source_column": null, "source_row": null, "source_table": "B0076", "unit": "percent"}}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:39.017570Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_result", "id": "E0003", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 53.8, "x1": 295.56, "y0": 86.48, "y1": 194.07}, "block": "B0076", "char_end": 191, "char_start": 29, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 3, "section_path": ["2 RELATED WORK", "2.2 Pre-training Models"], "text_hash": "sha256:aae95ef21880648832e0d2409389bb7b6464b8f27be48ba7d33fc35936743c3f", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "indirect", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:08.711708Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span states the metric, the value, the dataset and the system it belongs to.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:08.711688Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "outperforms existing works remarkably by 5.4%, 0.2%, 5.2%, 4.4%, 10.0%", "field": "traffic.metrics", "negative_state": null, "numeric": {"condition": {"task": "GEAC"}, "dataset": "Cross-Platform (Android)", "metric": "improvement over prior state of the art", "parsed": 5.4, "raw": "5.4%", "source_column": null, "source_row": null, "source_table": "B0066", "unit": "percentage point"}}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:39.021233Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_result", "id": "E0004", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": "the five improvement figures are not mapped to datasets in the source; treat 5.4% as 'one of five reported improvements', not as the Cross-Platform (Android) figure", "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.69, "x1": 559.71, "y0": 86.48, "y1": 128.32}, "block": "B0066", "char_end": 128, "char_start": 58, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 2, "section_path": ["KEYWORDS"], "text_hash": "sha256:456a09bf976035764df97aa0fe243fc6e98fbe8f5b8fb26298fb72c981f31bdb", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:14.011289Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The five improvements are listed without naming which dataset each belongs to; the candidate's assignment of 5.4% to Cross-Platform (Android) is not established by this span.", "review_action": "accept_with_qualification", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:14.011272Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "partially_supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "Generalizability: The variability of encrypted traffic due to changes in the content of Internet services [14] over time will challenge the ability of our approach with fixed patterns leaned from fixed data and keeping unchanged over time.", "field": "traffic.author_stated_limitations", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:39.111855Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "limitation", "id": "E0005", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 53.47, "x1": 294.05, "y0": 642.83, "y1": 706.59}, "block": "B0234", "char_end": 391, "char_start": 152, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 8, "section_path": ["5 DISCUSSION"], "text_hash": "sha256:f3ac52415ae7ceb5c284c1b42aad31ab347412da6093527fc873f63a0a260703", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:19.009169Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The Discussion section states this generalizability limitation directly.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:19.009151Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "Although ET-BERT has good robustness and generalization under a variety of encrypted traffic scenarios, it depends on the clean pre-training data.", "field": "traffic.author_stated_limitations", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:39.115396Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "limitation", "id": "E0006", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.95, "x1": 559.72, "y0": 249.92, "y1": 390.4}, "block": "B0245", "char_end": 437, "char_start": 291, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 8, "section_path": ["5 DISCUSSION"], "text_hash": "sha256:88aa3b3287a308aad8f957ea018f68c8bd8c64f02387e21376c4eadec96f10f5", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:24.095949Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The paper states the dependence on clean pre-training data as a limitation.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:24.095932Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "In this work, around 30GB of unlabeled traffic data is used for pre-training. This dataset contains two parts: (1) about 15GB traffic from the public datasets [9, 32]; (2) about 15GB traffic from our passively collected traffic under the China Science and Technology Network (CSTNET).", "field": "traffic.dataset", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:38.905264Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "dataset_description", "id": "E0013", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 53.53, "x1": 295.1, "y0": 127.02, "y1": 223.66}, "block": "B0187", "char_end": 306, "char_start": 22, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 5, "section_path": ["𝐿𝑆𝐵𝑃 = −"], "text_hash": "sha256:44ee804409f34eeda5c14b7686a39ac069d65f380f20890093011b1c9bdc435d", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:59.076538Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span names the pre-training corpus and its two halves.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:59.076521Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "We test on Cross-Platform (iOS) [37] and Cross-Platform (Android) [37], which contain 196 and 215 applications respectively.", "field": "traffic.dataset", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:38.908966Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_setup", "id": "E0014", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.64, "x1": 559.58, "y0": 254.05, "y1": 328.77}, "block": "B0198", "char_end": 263, "char_start": 139, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 5, "section_path": ["4 EXPERIMENTS", "4.1 Experiment Setup"], "text_hash": "sha256:3b9f58d7686a7cc7237a39c80c670c344633c1d873595dce568de181c42783f9", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:04.454438Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span names two evaluation datasets.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:04.454420Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "The dataset [10] is called ISCX-Tor, which contains 16 applications.", "field": "traffic.dataset", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:38.912570Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_setup", "id": "E0015", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.69, "x1": 558.74, "y0": 495.15, "y1": 580.83}, "block": "B0201", "char_end": 239, "char_start": 171, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 5, "section_path": ["4 EXPERIMENTS", "4.1 Experiment Setup"], "text_hash": "sha256:cfca3a4e22e13673ec0f116f96cb634a31511d4b60bfb18f4013be62504c605f", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:09.825414Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span names the dataset.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:09.825397Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "the dataset contains rich network protocols, such as a new encryption protocol based on UDP transport QUIC, Transport Layer Security, File Transfer Protocol, Hyper Text Transfer Protocol, Secure Shell", "field": "traffic.encryption_status", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:38.974660Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "dataset_description", "id": "E0019", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 53.53, "x1": 295.1, "y0": 127.02, "y1": 223.66}, "block": "B0187", "char_end": 516, "char_start": 316, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 5, "section_path": ["𝐿𝑆𝐵𝑃 = −"], "text_hash": "sha256:44ee804409f34eeda5c14b7686a39ac069d65f380f20890093011b1c9bdc435d", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:37.279888Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The listed protocols include both encrypted and plaintext ones.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:37.279867Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "Then BURST2Token process transforms the datagram in each BURST to token embeddings via the bi-gram model.", "field": "traffic.tokenization", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:38.764865Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "method_description", "id": "E0030", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212435Z_22182ebd", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0001-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.95, "x1": 559.72, "y0": 86.48, "y1": 205.03}, "block": "B0084", "char_end": 403, "char_start": 298, "file_hash": "sha256:58aa3e70435005e9400b67873a25e6b529a01c81bc85dd18c1b658412d7de339", "page": 3, "section_path": ["3 ET-BERT", "3.2 Datagram2Token Traffic Representation"], "text_hash": "sha256:c42c92e9ea223a1bda552aaf310c7bd5d8bade403414c7040d06407aa3982aee", "version": "V0001-1", "work": "W0001"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:37.821418Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span names the tokenisation scheme.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:37.821401Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
